    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong style=\"font-weight:normal\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-ce01ab11-7fff-c0a9-c012-449c4d1a3cb3\">You relentlessly seek the truth. Perhaps you're a journalist who wishes to reveal the secrets of the world for all to see. Or maybe you're a private detective, uncovering secrets for well-paying clients. Whether the mysteries you're embroiled in are local crimes or world-spanning conspiracies, you're driven by a personal need to hunt down even the most elusive clues and reveal what others would keep hidden in the shadows.</strong></p><hr /><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Skill Proficiencies: </strong>Choose two from among Insight, Investigation, or Perception</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Tool Proficiencies: </strong>Pick two of Disguise Kit, Forgery Kit, Thieves' Tools, or Hacker's Tools</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Languages: </strong>None</p><p><strong>Equipment: </strong>A set of common clothes, a notepad and pen, a smartphone with a built-in camera and microphone, and a cryptostick with 1000 cp</p><p><strong>Feature:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.cyberpunk-5e.cyberpunk-backgrounds.Item.0ePjGZHvtTqysP5P]{Official Inquiry}</p>",
